d when the missile struck","chinese":"导弹袭击造成12人死亡"},{"english":"my head struck against a beam","chinese":"我的头撞在横梁上"}]},{"id":"strike:o:789830cc292a","label":"vi.","definitionZh":"击打","glossesEn":["with hand, weapon, implement"],"registers":["formal"],"examples":[{"english":"hold the nail, take the hammer, and strike sharply","chinese":"捏住钉子，拿起锤子，使劲敲"}]},{"id":"strike:o:67b6e0b06e6b","label":"vi.","definitionZh":"袭击","glossesEn":["attack"],"examples":[{"english":"the generals will decide when the time is right to strike","chinese":"将军们会决定何时可以发起进攻"}]},{"id":"strike:o:3589da30a8c0","label":"vi.","definitionZh":"突然发生","glossesEn":["occur"],"examples":[{"english":"tragedy struck when her husband was killed in a car crash","chinese":"悲剧发生了，她的丈夫在一次车祸中丧生"}]},{"id":"strike:o:8e62cbc0ba57","label":"vi.","definitionZh":"罢工","glossesEn":["take industrial action"],"examples":[{"english":"to strike for a pay increase","chinese":"罢工要求加薪"},{"english":"to strike over job losses","chinese":"因失业问题进行罢工"}]},{"id":"strike:o:67b0608d4064","label":"vi.","definitionZh":"报时","glossesEn":["chime"],"examples":[{"english":"did you hear the clock strike?","chinese":"你听到钟响了吗？"},{"english":"six o'clock was striking as I left","chinese":"我离开时，钟正敲6点"}]},{"id":"strike:o:ddb07eaca0f6","label":"vi.","definitionZh":"被划燃","glossesEn":["ignite"],"contexts":["match"],"examples":[{"english":"damp matches won't strike","chinese":"湿火柴划不着"}]},{"id":"strike:o:729c27a28052","label":"vi.","definitionZh":"行进","glossesEn":["proceed"],"examples":[{"english":"to strike north","chinese":"向北走"},{"english":"they struck across an open field","chinese":"他们穿过了空旷的田野"}]},{"id":"strike:o:669392051a31","label":"vi.","definitionZh":"急拉钓线把鱼钩住","glossesEn":["secure hook"],"domains":["Fishing"],"contexts":["angler"]},{"id":"strike:o:a5e5236588c5","label":"vi.","definitionZh":"上钩","glossesEn":["bite"],"contexts":["fish"]},{"id":"strike:o:14b2dc022ed1","label":"n.","definitionZh":"罢工","glossesEn":["withdrawal of labour"],"examples":