lish":"let's just drop the subject","chinese":"我们别再谈这事儿了"}]},{"id":"subject:o:49d75804f3e9","label":"n.","definitionZh":"科目","glossesEn":["branch of knowledge"],"examples":[{"english":"French is her best/favourite subject","chinese":"法语是她成绩最好/最喜欢的科目"}]},{"id":"subject:o:57446e7c5e61","label":"n.","definitionZh":"表现对象","domains":["Art","Photography"],"examples":[{"english":"to focus the camera on the subject","chinese":"将相机聚焦到拍摄对象上"},{"english":"landscapes were a popular subject with many 18th century painters","chinese":"风景是18世纪很多画家喜欢的表现题材"}]},{"id":"subject:o:49d109a0161c","label":"n.","definitionZh":"实验对象","glossesEn":["in experiment"],"examples":[{"english":"male subjects between the ages of 18 and 25","chinese":"18至25岁之间的男性实验对象"}]},{"id":"subject:o:64bf9aca0640","label":"n.","definitionZh":"缘由","glossesEn":["focus"],"examples":[{"english":"a subject of dispute","chinese":"争端的起因"},{"english":"he's become a subject for ridicule","chinese":"他成了别人讥笑讽刺的对象"}]},{"id":"subject:o:05d936f94151","label":"n.","definitionZh":"主语","domains":["Linguistics"]},{"id":"subject:o:22438bbea72f","label":"n.","definitionZh":"臣民","glossesEn":["citizen"],"examples":[{"english":"a British subject","chinese":"英国国民"}]},{"id":"subject:o:735350f33ded","label":"adj.","definitionZh":"可能遭受…；价格有可能变动","glossesEn":["liable"],"examples":[{"english":"prices are subject to alteration","chinese":"价格有可能变动"}]},{"id":"subject:o:4577c8330eff","label":"adj.","definitionZh":"取决于某事物；提案需经股东批准","glossesEn":["dependent"],"examples":[{"english":"the proposal is subject to approval by the shareholders","chinese":"提案需经股东批准"}]},{"id":"subject:o:00c4c8e4b202","label":"adj.","definitionZh":"受某事物支配；该岛不受英国法律制约","glossesEn":["obliged to obey"],"examples":[{"english":"the island is not subject to British law","chinese":"该岛不受英国法律制约"}]},{"id":"subject:o:b4c4c8f04830","label":"adj.","definitionZh":"臣服的","glossesEn":["subservient"],"registers":["formal"],"examples":[{"english":"the Greeks were the first subject people to break free from Ottoman rule","chinese":"希腊人是第一个挣脱奥斯曼帝国统治的民族"}]},{"id":"subject:o:66eba72c6da9","label":"prep. phr.","definitionZh":"取决于","examples":[{"english":"subject to the EU's agreement, …","chinese":"根据欧盟协议，…"},{"english":"you will be granted membership, subject to producing certain documents","chinese":"只要提供一些文件，你就可以成为会员"}]},{"id":"subject:o:6913f2a02568","label":"vt.","definitionZh":"使臣服","registers":["formal"],"examples":[{"english":"to be subjected to bombing/ridicule","chinese":"遭到轰炸/受到嘲笑"}]}]},"surmise":{"senses":[{"id":"surmise:o:5561bc25e202","label":"vt.","definitionZh":"猜测","contexts":["answer"],"examples":[{"english":"we can only surmise what happened","chinese":"我们只能推测发生了什么事"}]},{"id":"surmise:o:810abb07794e","label":"n.","definitionZh":"推测"}]},"talk":{"senses":[{"id":"talk:o:89c8f0468514","label":"vi.","definitionZh":"谈话","glossesEn":["speak, converse"],"examples":[{"english":"to know what one is talking about","chinese":"精于此道"},{"english":"he hasn't a clue what he's talking about","chinese":"他不谙此道"},{"english":"he's talking about or of getting a job","chinese":"他说的是找工作的事"}]},{"id":"talk:o:460492c50298","label":"vi.","definitionZh":"能说话","glossesEn":["have the power of speech"],"examples":[{"english":"can your little boy talk yet?","chinese":"你的小儿子会说话了吗？"}]},{"id":"talk:o:51c663c3b409","label":"vi.","definitionZh":"说闲话","glossesEn":["gossip"],"registers":["derogatory"],"examples":[{"english":"to give people something to talk about","chinese":"给人们留下谈资"},{"english":"to be or get oneself talked about","chinese":"招人议论"}]},{"id":"talk:o:b934c0f791b2","label":"vi.","definitionZh":"招供","glossesEn":["give information under coercion"],"examples":[{"english":"to make sb talk","chinese":"使某人招供"},{"english":"the prisoner refused to talk","chinese":"囚犯拒绝交待"}]},{"id":"talk:o:92b693e5379e","label":"vt.","definitionZh":"谈论","glossesEn":["discuss"],"contexts":["business","politics","sport"]},{"id":"talk:o:d3ab64d02c75","label":"vt.","definitionZh":"说","glossesEn":["express in speech"],"examples":[{"english":"you're talking sense!","chinese":"你说的话有道理！"},{"english":"to talk rubbish or nonsense","chinese":"说废话"},{"english":"we're talking £2 million/three years","chinese":"这将花费200万英镑/3年"}]},{"id":"talk:o:c468583391c5","label":"vt.","definitionZh":"说服某人做/不要做某事","glossesEn":["persuade"]},{"id":"talk:o:521aeaac3211","label":"vt.","definitionZh":"讲","glossesEn":["speak in language"],"contexts":["English","Chinese","French"]},{"id":"talk:o:fd9482a632b0","label":"vt.","definitionZh":"讲得","glossesEn":["bring into certain condition"],"examples":[{"english":"he talked himself hoarse/to a standstill!","chinese":"他讲得声音都嘶哑了/精疲力竭！"},{"english":"he's hoping to talk himself out of trouble","chinese":"他希望力陈理由以摆脱麻烦"},{"english":"to talk oneself or one's way into/out of sth/doing sth","chinese":"靠能说会道使自己做/免于做某事"}]},{"id":"talk:o:a213b5222fb9","label":"n.","definitionZh":"谈话","glossesEn":["conversation"],"examples":[{"english":"a formal/an informal talk","chinese":"正式/非正式谈话"},{"english":"to have a talk with sb (about sb/sth)","chinese":"（就某人/某事物）同某人交谈"},{"english":"a heart-to-heart talk","chinese":"谈心"}]},{"id":"talk:o:1ecd8ed3f25b","label":"n.","definitionZh":"说话","glossesEn":["talking"],"examples":[{"english":"small/sweet/baby talk","chinese":"闲聊/甜言蜜语/儿语"},{"english":"fast or double talk","chinese":"花言巧语"},{"english":"blunt or plain or straight talk","chinese":"直截了当的话"}]},{"id":"talk:o:4ac6ed05dbad","label":"n.","definitionZh":"谣言","glossesEn":["rumours"],"examples":[{"english":"idle/loose talk","chinese":"闲话/信口乱说"},{"english":"the talk of the town","chinese":"街谈巷议"}]},{"id":"talk:o:a111c3cf8317","label":"n.","definitionZh":"闲话","glossesEn":["gossip"]},{"id":"talk:o:92f0c8c19d68","label":"n.","definitionZh":"讲座","glossesEn":["lecture"],"examples":[{"english":"an academic/informal talk","chinese":"学术/非正式演讲"},{"english":"a talk on or about deep-sea fishing/acupuncture","chinese":"关于深海捕鱼/针灸的讲座"},{"english":"a talk on radio/TV","chinese":"广播/电视演说"}]},