 she realize that …","chinese":"直到那时她才意识到…"}]},{"id":"until:o:fe0d44cc7e53","label":"conj.","definitionZh":"直到","glossesEn":["up to the time when"],"examples":[{"english":"to wait until one is alone","chinese":"一直等到只剩下自己一个人"}]},{"id":"until:o:8d1815093d69","label":"conj.","definitionZh":"在…以前","glossesEn":["used with a negative"],"examples":[{"english":"I can't decide until I know the details","chinese":"我得了解了详情才能决定"},{"english":"I won't leave until I've seen him","chinese":"我要到看见了他以后才离开"},{"english":"don't look until I tell you to","chinese":"我让你看你再看"}]}]},"writing":{"senses":[{"id":"writing:o:d85f00f43889","label":"n.","definitionZh":"书写","glossesEn":["skill"]},{"id":"writing:o:18bdf60c7ee2","label":"n.","definitionZh":"文字","glossesEn":["words and letters"],"examples":[{"english":"the writing is on the wall","chinese":"显然厄运临头了"}]},{"id":"writing:o:51920c836592","label":"n.","definitionZh":"笔迹","glossesEn":["handwriting"],"examples":[{"english":"his writing is poor/good","chinese":"他的字写得差/好"}]},{"id":"writing:o:54826ba78227","label":"n.","definitionZh":"写作","glossesEn":["authorship"]},{"id":"writing:o:8472f4474cee","label":"n.","definitionZh":"写作风格","glossesEn":["literary style"]},{"id":"writing:o:0607bbbaf0a6","label":"n.","definitionZh":"文学作品","glossesEn":["literature"]},{"id":"writing:o:f25c8b9db85b","label":"n. pl.","definitionZh":"作品"}]}}}